<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Heal Animal</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Ranger (guild level 5, up to 60%), Druid (guild level 13)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast heal animal &lt;animal&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster beckons to the gods to heal an animal: a beast, bird, reptile, 
amphibian, insect or worm. It won't work on people, monsters of other 
kinds, or yourself. It is most useful for looking after an animal you have 
charmed or summoned.
</p><p>It restores between half your skill in the spell and half your skill plus 
30 hit points: from 30 to 60 at 60%, and from 50 to 80 at 100%. It can 
be cast while fighting. It is also found on potions, scrolls and staffs.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Charm Animal</a>
